                        <h2 class="pa-document__heading">Introduction</h2>
                        <p class="pa-document__text">This framework provides a compact, data-focused component system for building admin interfaces. The sections below describe scope and goals.</p>

                        <section class="pa-document__section">
                            <h3 class="pa-document__heading">Scope</h3>
                            <p class="pa-document__text">Covers layout, forms, data display and feedback components. Numbers here are generated by CSS, not written by hand.</p>
                        </section>

                        <section class="pa-document__section">
                            <h3 class="pa-document__heading">Goals</h3>
                            <p class="pa-document__text">Predictable markup, one canonical structure per component, and runtime theming.</p>

                            <section class="pa-document__section">
                                <h4 class="pa-document__heading">Rigidity over flexibility</h4>
                                <p class="pa-document__text">A single blessed shape per slot so code generators emit one DOM tree.</p>
                            </section>
                            <section class="pa-document__section">
