<!-- Real-world example: full document with a table inside a chapter -->
<div class="pa-card mb-8">
    <div class="pa-card__header">
        <div class="pa-card__title">
            <h3 class="pa-card__title-text">Real-world example — Customer discount program</h3>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pa-card__body">
        <p class="pa-text pa-text--secondary mb-4">A policy document: numbered chapters and sub-clauses, with a data table sitting inside chapter&nbsp;3. The table is just ordinary content within a <code>pa-document__section</code> — it does not affect the numbering of the surrounding clauses.</p>

        <div class="pa-document">
            <section class="pa-document__section">
                <h2 class="pa-document__heading">Purpose</h2>
                <p class="pa-document__text">This policy defines how volume-based discounts are calculated and applied to eligible business customers. It governs standard discounts only; individually negotiated contracts take precedence where they exist.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="pa-document__section">
                <h2 class="pa-document__heading">Eligibility</h2>
                <p class="pa-document__text">A customer must satisfy every condition below to qualify for a discount tier.</p>

                <section class="pa-document__section">
                    <h3 class="pa-document__heading">Account standing</h3>
                    <p class="pa-document__text">The account must be active, verified, and free of overdue invoices older than 30 days at the time the tier is evaluated.</p>
                </section>

                <section class="pa-document__section">
                    <h3 class="pa-document__heading">Order history</h3>
                    <p class="pa-document__text">Eligibility is based on the trailing twelve months of completed, non-refunded orders. New accounts start at the Bronze tier once their first order is fulfilled.</p>
                </section>
            </section>

            <section class="pa-document__section">
                <h2 class="pa-document__heading">Discount tiers</h2>
                <p class="pa-document__text">Tiers are determined by trailing-twelve-month spend. The discount is applied to the net order subtotal before tax and shipping.</p>

                <!-- Wrapped in .pa-table-container so the table scrolls
                     horizontally on a narrow screen instead of stretching the
                     document; the document strips the wrapper's frame. -->
                <div class="pa-table-container mb-4">
                    <table class="pa-table pa-table--striped pa-table--bordered">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Tier</th>
                                <th>Annual spend (trailing 12&nbsp;mo)</th>
                                <th>Standard discount</th>
                                <th>Free shipping</th>
                                <th>Dedicated support</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="pa-badge">Bronze</span></td>
                                <td>&euro;0 – &euro;4,999</td>
                                <td>3%</td>
                                <td>—</td>
                                <td>—</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="pa-badge pa-badge--secondary">Silver</span></td>
                                <td>&euro;5,000 – &euro;19,999</td>
                                <td>7%</td>
                                <td>✓</td>
                                <td>—</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="pa-badge pa-badge--warning">Gold</span></td>
                                <td>&euro;20,000 – &euro;49,999</td>
                                <td>12%</td>
                                <td>✓</td>
                                <td>Business hours</td>
                            </tr>
                            <tr>
                                <td><span class="pa-badge pa-badge--primary">Platinum</span></td>
                                <td>&euro;50,000+</td>
                                <td>18%</td>
                                <td>✓</td>
                                <td>24/7</td>
                            </tr>
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>

                <section class="pa-document__section">
                    <h3 class="pa-document__heading">Tier assignment</h3>
                    <p class="pa-document__text">Tiers are recalculated on the first day of each month. An upgrade takes effect immediately; a downgrade is deferred by one full billing cycle so customers are never dropped mid-month.</p>
                </section>

                <section class="pa-document__section">
                    <h3 class="pa-document__heading">Combining discounts</h3>
                    <p class="pa-document__text">Tier discounts do not stack with promotional coupon codes. When both apply, the customer receives whichever single discount is larger.</p>

                    <section class="pa-document__section">
                        <h4 class="pa-document__heading">Seasonal campaigns</h4>
                        <p class="pa-document__text">During advertised seasonal campaigns, the campaign rate replaces the tier rate for the campaign period only, then reverts automatically.</p>
                    </section>
                </section>
            </section>

            <section class="pa-document__section">
                <h2 class="pa-document__heading">Exclusions</h2>
                <p class="pa-document__text">The following are never discounted, regardless of tier.</p>

                <section class="pa-document__section">
                    <h3 class="pa-document__heading">Non-qualifying products</h3>
                    <p class="pa-document__text">Gift cards, third-party marketplace items, and services billed by a partner are excluded from the discountable subtotal.</p>
                </section>

                <section class="pa-document__section">
                    <h3 class="pa-document__heading">Chargebacks and abuse</h3>
                    <p class="pa-document__text">Accounts with an open chargeback dispute are suspended from the program until the dispute is resolved.</p>
                </section>
            </section>

            <section class="pa-document__section">
                <h2 class="pa-document__heading">Review and adjustment</h2>
                <p class="pa-document__text">These thresholds are reviewed annually. The company may adjust rates or bands with 30 days' notice to affected customers.</p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- CSS Classes Reference -->
<div class="pa-card">
    <div class="pa-card__header">
        <div class="pa-card__title">
            <h3 class="pa-card__title-text">CSS Classes Reference</h3>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pa-card__body">
        <h5 class="mt-4">Structure</h5>
        <ul class="pa-list-basic pa-list-basic--compact">
            <li><code>pa-document</code> - Document root; establishes the numbering context</li>
            <li><code>pa-document__section</code> - A section; nest sections directly to build the hierarchy</li>
            <li><code>pa-document__heading</code> - Section heading; carries the auto-generated number</li>
            <li><code>pa-document__text</code> - Body paragraph beneath a heading</li>
            <li><code>pa-document__number</code> - Author-written number (manual mode only)</li>
        </ul>

        <h5 class="mt-4">Modifiers</h5>
        <ul class="pa-list-basic pa-list-basic--compact">
            <li><code>pa-document--manual</code> - Disable auto counters; author numbers via <code>pa-document__number</code></li>
            <li><code>pa-document--compact</code> - Tighter spacing between sections</li>
            <li><code>pa-document--spacious</code> - Looser spacing between sections</li>
            <li><code>pa-document--flush</code> - Remove per-level indentation</li>
        </ul>

        <h5 class="mt-4">Runtime tokens (CSS variables)</h5>
        <ul class="pa-list-basic pa-list-basic--compact">
            <li><code>--pa-document-indent</code> - Indentation added per nesting level</li>
            <li><code>--pa-document-section-gap</code> - Vertical rhythm between sections</li>
            <li><code>--pa-document-number-color</code> - Colour of the number (defaults to accent)</li>
            <li><code>--pa-document-number-gap</code> - Space between the number and heading text</li>
        </ul>

        <p class="pa-text pa-text--secondary mt-4">Auto numbering is generated with per-depth CSS counters up to six levels deep — enough for admin documentation (Word itself caps at nine). Sections nested deeper simply stop showing a number.</p>
    </div>
</div>
